# v40 head-to-head: a450+Eugen 33W Kyo4 0.859/0.687/0.842 BEST hard6 +12.5pp vs 35W, a450+35W 0.861/0.696/0.717
# v41 adds: SPREAD (Dragapult 121, Alakazam 245/743, Dusknoir 133), SWARM (Ogerpon 95/96, Dipplin 93/347/921), LOCK (Bronzong 55/837, Trevenant 879/1311)
